t":"2025-09-20T06:46:04.544Z","lastActive":"2026-08-16T07:16:26.842Z","status":"offline","id":"68ce4dac5100bcf3f3ef8ca6","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/06c7debf4a70e0172f06c769dafe54a284a5dc51579a88f4b04eec99e5b6e92e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68ce4dac5100bcf3f3ef8ca6-1758350881791.png"}},"text":"@romaegriscin to explain, i play a game where people team up a lot, which makes the game unfair for people who aren't teaming. a key strategy is to get rid of teamers, and the most efficient way to spot teamers is to check everyone's friends list so you can see who's friends with who. the purpose of the script is to automatically spot potential teamers so i can strategize around that.","parent":{"_id":"68d9227ba8112fa7aff84fc9","commentBy":{"_id":"67b973d016ad674ea943d9de","username":"romaegriscin","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"67b973d016ad674ea943d9de"},"text":"Who need it? Spy?"},"edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-11-17T08:43:43.923Z","liked":false,"disliked":false}]}